    "detailed_description": "Angularis is similar to Tetris, but based on triangles instead of squares. This makes it possible and necessary to also use diagonal movements. Challenge yourself to &quot;Think Diagonally&quot; and try this new spin on a classic puzzle game.<br />\r\n6 different types of shapes come falling down in random order one after the other.<br />\r\nYour task is to rotate each shapes and move it left or right so that they all fall nicely and fill the game board.<br />\r\nOnce you have filled a horizontal row completely it will be cleared and you earn points and reach the next level.<br />\r\nThe speed of the falling parts increases with each level.",
